  "zh": "# 西藏地震、iPhone Duo 折叠屏问题、OpenAI API 开放等重大事件 today 引发广泛关注\n\n## 自然灾害与社会影响\n- **西藏7.0级地震造成16死54伤**：地震引发大规模救援响应，影响西藏地区居民生活\n- **长征精神与红军历史研究**：国家英雄事迹宣传持续深入，激励青年群体\n\n## 科技产品与技术突破\n- **iPhone Duo 折叠屏验机教程爆火**：折叠屏问题引发用户焦虑，推动厂商快速响应\n- **OpenAI 开放 Decisions API**：AI 模型实时决策能力展现，推动企业应用落地\n\n## 平台与生态变革\n- **Quad9 DNS Resolver 宣布退出法国市场**：跨境服务撤离引发行业关注，影响全球命名空间\n- **iOS 16.5 成功在 Android 设备上运行**：跨平台兼容性突破，重塑移动操作系统生态\n\n## 行业与法律影响\n- **Meta 被判 250 亿美元罚款**：社交媒体巨头面临巨额惩罚，监管压力持续增大\n- **西藏地震余震持续监测**：多地仍有余震记录，救援工作持续进行",
  "en": "# Today's top tech news covers major earthquakes, iPhone Duo fold issues, and AI API openings\n\n## Natural Disasters & Society\n- **Tibetan earthquake claims 16 dead**: Massive rescue operations triggered by seismic event\n- **Long March spirit research continues national promotion**: Inspires youth and strengthens cultural heritage awareness\n\n## Technology & Innovations\n- **iPhone Duo fold screen issues spark public concern**: Quality control questions rise amid product launch\n- **OpenAI opens Decision API for enterprise use**: Real-time AI decision capabilities demonstrate rapid progress\n\n## Platform & Ecosystem Changes\n- **Quad9 leaves French market after strategic exit**: Cross-border service withdrawal impacts global DNS ecosystem\n- **iOS 16.5 achieves cross-platform compatibility on Android**: Technological leap reshapes mobile operating system landscape\n\n## Industry & Legal Developments\n- **Meta fined $250 billion for antitrust violations**: Tech giant faces severe legal consequences worldwide\n- **Ongoing aftershocks remain active in Tibet region**: Continued monitoring required as recovery progresses"
}